      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft you can adapt for your system. It balances the praise with the necessary constructive feedback.\n\n\"\\[Employee Name] has demonstrated exceptional performance this review period, particularly in the area of client retention. Their proactive approach to nurturing client relationships has resulted in a significant increase in account stability, consistently exceeding our departmental goals for keeping key accounts on board. This dedication to client success is a major asset to our team, and their ability to secure renewals is truly commendable.\n\nMoving forward, I want to focus on enhancing team synergy through consistent adherence to our operational schedules. While client-facing work is stellar, consistent punctuality for our daily stand-up meetings is an area requiring immediate attention. Being on time allows us to maximize our morning syncs, ensuring the entire team starts the day aligned and ready to tackle priorities. I am confident that by prioritizing timely attendance, \\[Employee Name] can elevate their overall contribution to the team's operational rhythm.\"",
      "source": "target",
