      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks this is good. i'm just a bit worried about how they'll take the part about being late. they're pretty sensitive about criticism. is there a way to word the punctuality part so it doesn't sound so harsh or aggressive? maybe something a bit more... lighthearted or gentle so it doesn't ruin the good vibes of the rest of the review?",
